# --- Private to this machine ---
# This repository is published as a worked example of the converter and the
# player. It is not the home of the prototype archive, the project's planning
# notes, or any tooling state. Anyone using it brings their own .prd files.
.claude/
.code-review-graph/
.codegraph/
docs/
history/
protos/

# --- Local machine config ---
.serve.json

# --- Generated output ---
# Rebuilt any time by: python3 convert.py protos/*.prd
out/prince-protos/
out/index.html

# out/html-conversions/ is NOT ignored. Those pages are written by hand and
# nothing regenerates them. They are what prototypes.mablahblah.com serves.

